es on as if nothing happened, until Su-ryeon breaks her silence.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zBxXBjESaRzHoN940jKKZgmt3Xt.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvWW91dGgtb2YtTWF5LSUyOEtvcmVhbi10di1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.9","title":"Warning Signs of a Disaster","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2021-05-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Overnight, Gwangju is overcome with violence, and victims pour into the hospital. Hui-tae and Myeong-hui put their plans on hold to help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hDpZSX7MSIZ8OeCylJPONWyaUcK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvWW91dGgtb2YtTWF5LSUyOEtvcmVhbi10di1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.10","title":"Goodness, Hypocrisy, Utmost Effort","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2021-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Once patients with gunshot wounds fill the ER, Hui-tae realizes that they'll have to leave now or never, but devastating news holds Myeong-hui back.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bTbPzGZU2zjRjvK6kMATqkaQRTX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvWW91dGgtb2YtTWF5LSUyOEtvcmVhbi10di1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.11","title":"Mudeung Stadium","season":1,"episode":11,"released":"2021-06-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Myeong-hui decides to stay put at the hospital, despite her family's plea to get away together. Hwang Jeong-tae witnesses a horrifying sight at home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zudTNOIjRfo9hopxHVWPeUbWthl.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjEvWW91dGgtb2YtTWF5LSUyOEtvcmVhbi10di1zZXJpZXMtMjAyMSUyOS8.1.12","title":"The First of May","season":1,"episode":12,"released":"2021-06-08T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In a simple ceremony with just the two of them, Hui-tae and Myeong-hui exchange prayers as wedding gifts. The tender moment is cut short by tragic news.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hfi71rXrLPVEG7KTulA4dCtaReG.jpg"}]}}